OL,3,AZoe Kleinman: PHP is the cyber
OL,4,Aequivalent of an unexploded bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe PHP story feels like the cyber
OL,7,Fequivalent of an unexploded bomb - I
OL,8,Fhave never seen such a dramatic, public
OL,9,Fand global response to a cyber event
OL,10,Fthat hasn't happened yet.
